# The build scripts write LF. With core.autocrlf=true and no attributes file, every
# checkout rewrote the working tree as CRLF, the builders then wrote LF into the
# header and footer regions, and 37 pages ended up with mixed line endings — which
# made "the diff is empty" impossible to rely on as proof.
#
# Pin LF everywhere. The repository already stores LF, so this changes no content.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
